# Build output. Not ignored by default the way node_modules is, so a repo that
# has ever been built fails `format:check` on generated manifests — and the fix
# people reach for, `pnpm format`, quietly rewrites Next's build output instead
# of saying so. Order matters here: `pnpm verify` checks formatting before it
# builds, so a clean clone passed and every working tree did not.
.next/
.turbo/
out/
**/dist/
coverage/
